# EMU486_I386 names a preassembled i386 object for emu486.s. common.make's
# LOCAL_OFILES has no rule that turns an SFILES-like variable into an
# object (there is no SFILES variable at all in this pb_makefiles vintage),
# so the build harness assembles emu486.s externally and hands the result
# in here; kernelserver.make's KL_LDFLAGS includes OPTIONAL_LDFLAGS, so it
# reaches the kl_ld link regardless of include order.
OPTIONAL_LDFLAGS = $(EMU486_I386)
